### Bounded Concurrency
- Use \`buffer_unordered\` for parallel execution with max concurrency
- MAX_CONCURRENT_QUERIES = 10 (configurable constant)
- Prevents overwhelming network or SSH agent with too many connections

### Per-Worker Timeout
- Each query has individual timeout (DEFAULT_QUERY_TIMEOUT = 10s)
- Timed-out workers return with reachable=false
- Use tokio::time::timeout wrapper inside query_single_worker

### Empty Workers Handling
- Return empty vec immediately if no workers provided
- Log at debug level

### Progress Reporting (Human Mode)
