## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] All comparison modes implemented (exact, normalized, semantic)
- [ ] Path normalization handles Linux/macOS/Windows patterns
- [ ] Timestamp stripping covers ISO 8601, build times, Unix timestamps
- [ ] Diff output is clear and actionable for debugging
