## Overview
Enhance the existing worker cards in the dashboard to display SpeedScore prominently with visual indicators for score quality, recent trends, and proper handling of loading/error/empty states.

## Background and Justification
Users need to quickly assess worker performance without drilling into details. A visual badge with color coding and trend arrows provides instant comprehension.

