## Overview
Create an expandable detail panel showing full SpeedScore breakdown with component scores, raw benchmark values, contextual explanations, and proper handling of all edge cases.

## Background and Justification
While the badge provides at-a-glance info, users investigating performance issues need detailed breakdown. This panel shows exactly what each component measures and how it contributes to the total.

